### Session Create Proof (Phase 1)

Environment note:
- Direct HTTP runtime capture is blocked in this sandbox because local listen/bind is not permitted.
- Contract below is validated by automated tests and route implementation.

POST /api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "projectId": "test_project",
  "apiKey": "test_key"
}

Expected 201 Response Body:
{
  "sessionId": "<uuid>",
  "wsToken": "<jwt>",
  "desktopUrl": "http://<host>/session/<sessionId>?token=<token>",
  "mobileUrl": "http://<host>/mobile?sessionId=<sessionId>&token=<token>",
  "expiresAt": 1760000000000
}

Validated by:
- `server/src/index.js` session route implementation.
- `server/test/httpMiddleware.test.js` (error/request-id standards).
- `server/test/sessionStore.test.js` (session lifecycle).
- `docs/phase-1/proofs/test-run.txt` (14 passing tests).
